  message: "2026-06-10 design-interview ruling (ADR-0041, merged in PR #4181): the supply-chain redesign reaffirms supply_chain as the single-source verdict surface (tier, directness meta key, and ecosystem axis all derive from one classification), so the conformant fix here is for the entrypoint detector to consume Symbol.supply_chain.is_test_file rather than re-deriving a test_*.py filename heuristic. Waits on the implementing fix after the ADR merges."  # 73b4
